-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §143: §135's additions to the position for a
-- mother and for six working days apply to completing kindergarten teachers
-- as well.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-135`
§ `143`

@ref akn:art_143
GIVEN `a mother` IS A BOOLEAN, `works six days` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `additions to a completing kindergarten teacher's position` `a mother` `works six days` IS
    `additions to a kindergarten teacher's position` `a mother` `works six days`
